  JAX implementation of :obj:`scipy.stats.dirichlet` ``logpdf``.

  The Dirichlet probability density function is

  .. math::

     f(\mathbf{x}) = \frac{1}{B(\mathbf{\alpha})} \prod_{i=1}^K x_i^{\alpha_i - 1}

